(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "news/social の fact-check を行い app-aozora に自律投稿する actor を、独立 FactGovernor + append-only 評定台帳で新設する判断" "publication は ADR-2606281500（種をまく）で autonomous by default — FactGovernor の HARD violation のみ publish を withheld" "tashikame は assess のみ（:effect :assessment）。actuation は行わない（publication ≠ actuation）")), (:adr/phases "[{:phase :r0, :state \"landed 2026-07-02\", :scope \"pure .cljc core (operation/governor/advisor/publisher/phase/store) + cacao/aozora JVM I/O + contract tests; repo + west + RAD registration\"}]"), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "actor-registration"), (:adr/related (vector "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-tashikame" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-tashikame/docs/adr/0001-architecture.md" "90-docs/adr/2606290000-sng-standalone-actor-r0.edn")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607022200-com-etzhayyim-tashikame-factcheck-aozora-actor-r0"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-02"), (:adr/body "\n# ADR-2607022200: com-etzhayyim-tashikame — fact-check verdict publisher → app-aozora (R0 scaffold)\n\n**Status**: accepted (R0 scaffold landed 2026-07-02)\n**Date**: 2026-07-02\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Context\n\nオーナー指示（2026-07-02）：**social post / news の fact-check を行い app-aozora に投稿する** actor を設計・統合せよ。この目的を一本で担う actor は存在しなかった。隣接 actor はそれぞれ範囲が違う:\n\n- **kawaraban** — news を mirror する MEDIUM。charter G1 で verdict 不可。\n- **danjo** — 政府データの discrepancy 観測。verdict を出さず、feed 投稿もしない。\n- **ake** — KG/profile の community-edit。claim verdict でなく、live publish は Council-gated。\n- **yomi** — intel assessment を**自身の台帳**に公開（aozora feed ではない）。\n\n## Decision\n\ntashikame（確かめ）を **workspace actor pattern** の fact-check instance として新設（robotaxi / gftd-talent / itonami / kyoninka / sng と同型）。設計の正本は子リポ `docs/adr/0001-architecture.md`。骨子:\n\n1. **封じ込め + 独立 FactGovernor + 不変台帳。** 知能ノード `factllm` は1ノードに封じ込め *proposal（評定 + 引用 + confidence）のみ* を返す（`:effect :assessment`）。独立系統の **FactGovernor** が検閲し、commit / hold に振る。commit/hold は append-only の評定台帳に積む。不変条件: *tashikame は FactGovernor が拒否した評定を決して投稿しない*。\n\n2. **langgraph-clj StateGraph, 1 run = 1 claim check。** 内部無限ループなし。`interrupt-before` なし — publication は自律(下記)。\n\n3. **自律投稿（ADR-2606281500 種をまく）。** publication は actor 自身の SPEECH で **autonomous by default**。per-post の operator/Council 事前制限なし。off-switch は publish 毎の revocable member CACAO leash（`:leash`）。**publication ≠ actuation**: tashikame は assess のみ。FactGovernor の HARD violation のみが publish を withheld する。\n\n4. **FactGovernor gates。**\n   - HARD → HOLD（記録、非投稿）: `:no-actuation` / `:uncited-conclusive`（conclusive rating に引用 0）/ `:malformed-citation` / `:catastrophe-veto`（Rider §2 scan）/ `:person-targeting`（私的個人への doxing。public-figure の claim-check は可）。\n   - SOFT → tag 付き投稿（block しない）: `:low-confidence`。\n\n5. **注入境界。** Store（`MemStore` ‖ `DatomicStore` ‖ kotoba-server）/ Advisor（mock ‖ `langchain.model` on Murakumo + read-only web gather）/ Publisher（Mock ‖ app-aozora createRecord）/ Phase（0 observe → 1 autonomous-publish）。コアは不変。\n\n6. **Store は `:db-api` 駆動。** `MemStore ≡ DatomicStore` contract test で保証。\n\n7. **自己主権 identity。** `tashikame.cacao`（`tsumugu.cacao` から port）+ `tashikame.aozora`（app-aozora createRecord）。秘密鍵は `.tashikame/identity.edn`（gitignore）。\n\n8. **`.cljc` portable**（JVM/SCI/cljs/WASM）。`.clj` は JVM-only I/O（cacao, aozora）のみ。\n\n## Registration（superproject 反映）\n\n- **子リポ**: `etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-tashikame` を作成し R0 scaffold を push（HEAD `7d66ce7`、lint/test green）。\n- **west manifest**: `manifest/repos.edn` に entry 追加 + `manifest/west.yml` は **tashikame の1 entry のみ single-entry 追加**。全面再生成は取らない（`west.yml` は他子リポで既に STALE/drift しており、再生成は local working HEAD で pin し直すため pin 退行の罠 — ADR-2606290000 sng precedent と同じ）。\n- **RAD identity**: `orgs/etzhayyim/root/80-data/kotoba-rad/tashikame.identity.journal.edn` に actor identity を積む（別 repo `etzhayyim/root` への別 commit）。\n\n## Consequences\n\n- (+) claim を fact-check し、governor-clean・引用 grounded・append-only 監査付きで per-post 人間 gating なしに評定投稿できるループができた。\n- (+) `factllm` は swap 可能（mock → Murakumo LLM）で、投稿保証（governor + 台帳）は不変。\n- (−) R0 `mock-advisor` は heuristic。実評価は deploy で LLM + read-only web gather を wire する必要。catastrophe-veto denylist は illustrative（canonical `etzhayyim_organism.sensors.charter_rider.scan` の wire は follow-up）。`:person-targeting` も R0 heuristic。\n\n## Notes\n\n- 本 ADR は superproject レベルの登録・位置づけが責務。設計の正本は子リポ `docs/adr/0001-architecture.md`。\n- actor pattern の同型性は `CLAUDE.md`「Actors」節に拠る。"), (:adr/decision "{:actor {:name \"tashikame\", :kanji \"確かめ\", :repo \"github.com/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-tashikame\", :path \"orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-tashikame\", :did-web \"did:web:etzhayyim.github.io:com-etzhayyim-tashikame\", :namespace \"com.etzhayyim.apps.tashikame.*\", :pattern \"containment + independent FactGovernor + append-only verdict ledger (langgraph-clj StateGraph, autonomous publication)\"}, :intelligence-node {:name \"factllm\", :effect :assessment, :proposal-only true}, :governor {:name \"FactGovernor\", :separate-system true}, :publish {:target \"app-aozora\", :collection \"com.etzhayyim.apps.tashikame.factCheck\", :xrpc \"com.atproto.repo.createRecord\", :auth \"depth-1 self-minted CACAO (self did:key) + revocable member CACAO leash (off-switch)\", :doctrine \"ADR-2606281500 (種をまく) — autonomous by default; publication ≠ actuation\"}, :seams {:store \"MemStore ‖ DatomicStore ‖ kotoba-server\", :advisor \"mock ‖ langchain.model on Murakumo + read-only web gather\", :publisher \"MockPublisher ‖ app-aozora createRecord\", :phase \"0 observe → 1 autonomous-publish (default)\"}}"), (:adr/honesty "{:r0-advisor \"mock-advisor is heuristic (cited→:supported, uncited→:unverifiable). Real LLM assessment + read-only web gather is a deploy follow-up, not faked at R0.\", :r0-governor \"catastrophe-veto denylist is illustrative until canonical etzhayyim_organism.sensors.charter_rider.scan is wired; :person-targeting is an R0 heuristic marker.\", :west-yml \"single-entry add only (not full regen) — west.yml is pre-existing STALE on other drifted children; full regen would silently repin them (sng precedent).\"}"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/problem "{:source \"owner directive 2026-07-02\", :gap \"news/social の fact-check を行い app-aozora に投稿する一本の actor がなかった（kawaraban=mirror-only/verdict不可, danjo=discrepancy観測のみ, ake=Council-gated community-edit, yomi=自台帳)\", :risk \"fact-check なしの情報拡散 / per-post 人間 gating だと scope が広がらず立たない / governor なしだと hallucinated な評定が流通する\"}"), (:adr/gates "{:hard-hold {:no-actuation \"proposal :effect ≠ :assessment\", :uncited-conclusive \"conclusive rating (:supported/:refuted/:misleading) with 0 cites\", :malformed-citation \"cite is not an absolute http(s) URL\", :catastrophe-veto \"Rider §2 catastrophe-veto scan hit\", :person-targeting \"doxing a private person (not public-figure claim-checking)\"}, :soft-tag {:low-confidence \"overall confidence < floor; publishes with :low-confidence tag\"}}"), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607022200: com-etzhayyim-tashikame — fact-check verdict publisher → app-aozora (R0 scaffold)"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))